# BizCity Twin AI context catalog

BizCity Twin AI is a self-hosted, WordPress-native business Second Brain that combines Graph RAG, memory, CRM, communication channels, and automation. Server-side `bizcity-llm-router` questions belong in that separate repository; this repository owns the WordPress client framework and its bundled extensions.

## Router

The `read` column names a local context contract when one exists; otherwise it gives the area's routing description. A `skip` value of `everything else` means that only the named context contract is needed for that area.

| area | path | read | skip |
|---|---|---|---|
| GitHub automation | .github | - (CI, DCO, release workflows, and repository collaboration metadata) | - |
| command-line entry points | bin | - (repository validators and command-line utilities) | - |
